## Adding a student

From your dashboard, use **Add Student** to link a student to your parent account. Once linked,
that student's attendance, activity and progress data appears on your dashboard.

## Progress reports and the handbook

- **Progress report** — a per-student academic summary, generated from results and activity
  entered by staff. It reflects whatever has been entered so far, so it may look incomplete
  partway through a term.
- **Handbook** — reference material for your institute (policies, term dates, and similar), not
  tied to any particular student.

## Payments

Any fees for your student are paid from this dashboard — see
[Paying Fees Online](/docs/shared-parent-payments) for how the payment and its confirmation work.
